# The Vercel project is now a REDIRECT STUB ONLY. The site moved to Cloudflare
# Pages on 2026-08-09 and is served from dist/. The only reason this project
# still exists is the host redirects in vercel.json, which keep
# usajobs-historical.vercel.app working — deleting the project kills those URLs
# permanently. The /api rewrites and CORS headers that used to be in
# vercel.json died with the serverless functions.
#
# (This explanation lives here rather than in vercel.json because that file is
# schema-validated and rejects unknown keys — a "_comment" property fails the
# deploy with `should NOT have additional property`.)
#
# Nothing below should ever be published, but `vercel --prod` uploads the
# working tree, so keep the list accurate in case the stub is redeployed.

# Local working copies. The site reads the parquet and static.json from R2.
data/

# Tests, and the Cloudflare Pages build output.
tests/
dist/

# R2 bucket CORS policy — infrastructure config applied with
# `wrangler r2 bucket cors set`. Nothing serves it.
r2-cors.json

.wrangler/
node_modules/
